/target/
**/*.DS_Store
.env
dist/
node_modules/

# IDE / assistant caches
.qoder/
.reasonix/
.codegraph/
.serena/
.impeccable/questions/
.freebuff/
.terse/
CLAUDE.md
.vscode/

# Python 脚本残留（scripts/ 下维护脚本如 sync-test-count.py 的字节码）
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Project-local runtime state is ignored,
# but the bundled default skills ship with the repo.
.deepseeknova/*
!.deepseeknova/skills/
# 审计日志等运行时产物可能在各 crate 的 cwd 落盘（测试/子命令运行目录）。
**/.deepseeknova/security/
